and very well followed.

00:09:39.660 --> 00:09:40.590
You'll want to check that out.

00:09:40.590 --> 00:09:43.170
We also get the Pending Home
Sales report on Thursday.

00:09:43.170 --> 00:09:45.633
That's going to be the
latest detail on that.

00:09:46.620 --> 00:09:48.420
One chart I want to throw
up here on your screen

00:09:48.420 --> 00:09:50.580
as well is this chart
showing mortgage rates.

00:09:50.580 --> 00:09:53.010
And I want you to contrast what we've seen

00:09:53.010 --> 00:09:57.390
over the course of this
year with mortgage rates,

00:09:57.390 --> 00:09:59.160
which have really risen a little bit,

00:09:59.160 --> 00:10:01.200
gone down a little bit,
but they're largely right

00:10:01.200 --> 00:10:03.630
where they were at the
beginning of the year

00:10:03.630 --> 00:10:05.250
to that chart you saw with new home sales.

